.TH "nvme_init_manage_export_nvms_receive_list_controllers" 9 "nvme_init_manage_export_nvms_receive_list_controllers" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
nvme_init_manage_export_nvms_receive_list_controllers \- Initialize passthru command for Manage Exported NVM Subsystem Receive - List Exported Controllers (message-based transports only)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" nvme_init_manage_export_nvms_receive_list_controllers
.BI "(struct libnvme_passthru_cmd *cmd "  ","
.BI "__u16 ecntlid "  ","
.BI "struct nvme_exported_ctrl_list *list "  ","
.BI "__u32 len "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "cmd" 12
Passthru command to use
.IP "ecntlid" 12
Return Exported Controllers with an Exported Controller
Identifier greater than or equal to this value
.IP "list" 12
User address to store the Exported Controller List data
structure, see \fIstruct nvme_exported_ctrl_list\fP
.IP "len" 12
The allocated length of \fIlist\fP
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Initializes the passthru command buffer for the Manage Exported NVM
Subsystem Receive command with SEL value
NVME_MANAGE_EXPORT_NVMS_RECV_SEL_LIST_CONTROLLERS.
